Before the investiture talks can even begin, the Speaker of the House needs deciding. [+ parlament_current_ciu +] is proposing that ERC takes it, but such an offer can always be negotiated.

- @ciu_speaker: Propose a [+ parlament_current_ciu +]-held Speaker of the House
- @erc_speaker: Let ERC keep the Speaker of the House
- @cup_speaker: Push for us to have the Speaker of the House

