Before the investiture talks can even begin, the Speaker of the House needs deciding. Given the results, [+ parlament_current_ciu +] expect us to facilitate them having it, but such an offer can always be negotiated.

- @ciu_speaker: Let [+ parlament_current_ciu +] have the Speaker of the House
- @cup_speaker: Offer the Speaker of the House to the CUP instead
- @erc_speaker: Keep the Speaker of the House for us

