Given the electoral results, we are expected to offer [+ parlament_current_ciu +] the Speaker of the House. However, this can of course be negotiated.

- @ciu_speaker: Support a [+ parlament_current_ciu +] Speaker of the House, as proposed
- @cup_speaker: Offer the Speaker of the House to the CUP
- @erc_speaker: Retain the Speaker of the House for ERC

