on-arrival: {!
    Q.party_resources -= Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_cup_cabinet_cost;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_kind = "government";
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_phase = 1;
    Q.parlament_coalition_leader = "erc";
    Q.parlament_coalition_follower = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_cabinet = ["erc", Q.parlament_current_ciu, "cup"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_sovereignty_cabinet.reduce(function (n, p) { return n + Q[p + "_parlament_s"]; }, 0);
    Q.parlament_coalition_support_seats = Q.parlament_coalition_cabinet_seats + 0;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president = Q.parlament_coalition_leader;
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_name = Q[Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president + "_leader"];
    Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president_gender = Q[Q.parlament_coalition_proposal_president + "_leader_gender"];


    if (!(Q.cup_endavant_strength + Q.cup_poblelliure_strength + Q.cup_thirdsector_strength > 0)) {
        Q.cup_endavant_strength = 35;
        Q.cup_poblelliure_strength = 35;
        Q.cup_thirdsector_strength = 20;
        Q.cup_endavant_dissent = 15;
        Q.cup_poblelliure_dissent = 15;
        Q.cup_thirdsector_dissent = 10;
    }
    Q.coalition_phase_timer = 1;
    Q.month_actions += 1;
!}
call: parlament_coalition_sovereignty.initialize

Before the investiture talks can even begin, the Speaker of the House needs deciding. [+ parlament_current_ciu +] is expecting to get it given the results, but that can surely always be negotiated.

- @ciu_speaker: Let [+ parlament_current_ciu +] have the Speaker of the House as expected
- @erc_speaker: Propose an ERC-held Speaker of the House
- @cup_speaker: Push for us to have the Speaker of the House

@ciu_speaker
title: Elect a [+ parlament_current_ciu +] Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = Q.parlament_current_ciu;
    switch (Q.parlament_current_ciu) {
        case "ciu":
            Q.speaker = "Núria de Gispert";
            Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            break;
        case "cdc":
        case "dl":
            Q.speaker = "Carles Campuzano";
            Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            break;
        case "pdcat":
            Q.speaker = "Lluís Corominas";
            Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            break;
        case "jxcat":
        case "junts":
            if (Q.junts_leader != "Laura Borràs") {
                Q.speaker = "Laura Borràs";
                Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            } else {
                Q.speaker = "Albert Batet";
                Q.speaker_gender = "m";
            }
            break;
        default:
            Q.speaker = "Elsa Artadi";
            Q.speaker_gender = "f";
            break;
    }
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@erc_speaker
title: Elect an ERC Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "erc";
    Q.speaker = Q.year < 2016 ? "Anna Simó" : "Roger Torrent";
    Q.speaker_gender = Q.year < 2016 ? "f" : "m";
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@cup_speaker
title: Elect a CUP Speaker of the House
on-arrival: {!
    Q.speaker_party = "cup";
    Q.speaker = Q.year < 2017 ? "Julià de Jòdar" : "Vidal Aragonés";
    Q.speaker_gender = "m";
!}
go-to: post_speaker

@post_speaker

[+ speaker +] ([+ speaker_party +]) will be the Speaker of the House for this legislature. Officially the second authority of the country, [+ speaker_party +] will now have a decisive role in the legislative agenda moving forwards.

- @post_event: And so, time passes...
